  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A positive point charge of magnitude 1.0 μC and a point charge q are separated by a distance d.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>An electron is placed at a distance d from the +1.0 μC charge. The electric force on the electron is zero.</p>\n<p>What is q?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">−4.0 μC</li><li data-label=\"B\">−2.0 μC</li><li data-label=\"C\">2.0 μC</li><li data-label=\"D\">4.0 μC</li></ol>"
  },
